NOT included in this release and are governed by the PhysioNet Credentialed
Health Data Use Agreement (https://physionet.org/content/mimiciv/view-dua/).
Users must independently obtain credentialed access to MIMIC and may not
redistribute MIMIC data or MIMIC-derived rows. Any scenario files you generate
from MIMIC using these tools inherit those PhysioNet DUA obligations. The
synthetic seed (scripts/gen_synthetic_seed.py) and the test fixtures
(tests/mimic/fixtures/) are fabricated and are released under the MIT license.
